!================= Router Configuration ===============
!=============== <Organization's Name> ================
!Author: Team 3
!Date: June 7th, 2026
!Objective: Provide a Global contiguration for Chufani's
!network devices.
!======================================================

!================ Configuración Global =====================
enable

clock set HH:MM:SS <Month. E. Jun> <Day> <Year>

configure terminal

hostname RF-Chufani

no ip domain lookup

banner motd #

